DESIGN NOTES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  * Adaptive (ADR-002/006): macOS/iPad regular width renders columnar SwiftUI Grids;
    iPhone compact width renders per-row TSCard stacks. isCompact via horizontalSizeClass.
  * @Observable BackupRestorePageModel (ADR-004): NO networking in the view. All reads +
    writes route through the injected BackupRestoreDataSource seam (web request('/backup/...')
    queries + mutations). SampleBackupRestoreDataSource (an actor) provides a fully working
    out-of-the-box surface; production binds the shared KMP backup adapter.
  * Every visible literal resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with the WEB key names verbatim.
    i18next {token} interpolation -> Apple String(format:) (everyNDays "Every %lldd",
    deleteConfigMessage "...%@...").
  * No charts / no maps in this unit (matches manifest). SI units: backup metadata is
    unit-agnostic control-plane data; formatBytes/fmtInt/durationMs/relative ported 1:1 and
    applied only at the display boundary.
  * Type names prefixed BackupRestore* to avoid collision with the existing dashboard-widget
    BackupRun / BackupRunStatus (TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/BackupMonitorWidget.Projection.swift).

